From e8704c8ade246440de78d3949b34192e908c0ca5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Witold=20Gre=C5=84?= <witold.gren@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:54:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Push notifications: Firebase registration
 (fcm-push-listener 4), motion in ws API

The legacy GCM registration used by fcm-push-listener 2 is rejected
(PHONE_REGISTRATION_ERROR) since June 2024. Port the listener to
fcm-push-listener 4 (Firebase installation + FCM register with the
Reolink Android app IDs, heartbeat acks) and enable the pushnoti
feature by default.

ws: a push notification sets motion for motion_timeout seconds (default
30, restarted by further notifications) and last_motion; snapshot_at
tells clients when the cached snapshot changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
